# Project Specification Authority

Cursor must always treat `docs/SER_PROJECT_SPEC.md` as the source of truth for research design, preprocessing, features, models, protocols, metrics, and Definition of Done.

When code, configuration, README, AGENTS.md, or any other document disagrees with the specification, the specification wins and the other artifact must be corrected.

## Hard constraints from the spec

- Six emotion classes only: angry, disgust, fear, happy, neutral, sad.
- Discard calm, surprise, pleasant_surprise.
- Log-mel shape is exactly 64 × 188 (input tensor 1 × 64 × 188).
- Protocols: random, speaker_independent, leave_one_corpus_out.
- Models: M0–M3 (CNN ± aug × BiLSTM ± aug).
- Never invent metrics, protocols, or architectures outside the spec.
- No notebooks.

Never implement anything contradicting the specification.
